          "id": "orders_by_tracking_status",
          "type": "line",
          "title": "Orders \u2014 finished vs in progress (Tracking service)",
          "description": "DELIVERED is the tracking state machine's terminal status, so 'finished' is the domain's own invariant rather than a convention invented for this metric. One tracking per order (uq_tracking_order_id), so counting trackings is counting orders.",
